# Nothing here is yours to set. `npx convex dev` writes .env.local itself:
#   CONVEX_URL       the client port
#   CONVEX_SITE_URL  the HTTP actions port, where this benchmark's routes live
# Both are chosen at start-up, so read them rather than hard-coding them.
#
# COMPUTE_SERVICE_URL is a deployment variable, not a dotenv one. Functions read it
# through process.env, which Convex populates from the deployment:
#   npx convex env set COMPUTE_SERVICE_URL http://127.0.0.1:9000
